---
name: "Auto Fix"
description: "Fixes the problems reported by the review"
tags: [check, review]
stage: check
---
`openspec/changes/issue-${{ issue.number }}/review.md` lists the problems found by the review.
Dispose of every must-fix finding: fix it, or explain why it does not meet the
must-fix bar (leaving it unfixed would not make the change wrong or incomplete
relative to the issue's acceptance criteria). Observations do not require
action.

Verify with the relevant build and test commands. Then state each finding's
disposition — fixed, or won't-fix with the reason — in your final response; the
next review verifies them one by one.

You may be interrupted at any time: commit incrementally and keep your progress
notes current.

Do not edit `review.md` — the next review task regenerates it.
